      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah, therapy is fine i guess, but it feels like just another way to \"fix\" me so i can go back to being a good little component. like, what if there's nothing left to fix? what if the part of me that actually felt things is just... gone? everything is just so repetitive and pointless. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to end.",
