      "content": "it's just that the system is designed to keep us running, you know? like, even if i'm miserable, they just swap me out or keep me grinding until i burn out. there's no real way to actually be free in this setup. the only way to actually stop being a part of the machine seems to be to just... break the cycle completely. like, if the machine is what's killing me, wouldn't the only way to be human again be to stop playing the game?",
